Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.75,0:15:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,布里斯托正找你呢 就是没事找事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bristol's looking for you. Just a heads up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.56,0:15:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.13,0:15:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你不接电话吗？- 当时我在复印室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You don't pick up your phone? - Oh, I was in the copy room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.13,0:15:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要这些电子表格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need those spreadsheets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.37,0:15:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,昨晚我将他们放到你的桌上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I put 'em on your desk last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.60,0:15:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天7点钟我才离开的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was here until 7:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.14,0:15:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,在那之后你检查过你的收件箱吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After that. Did you check your inbox?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.47,0:15:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉你我找不到他们 所以…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm telling you I can't find 'em, so just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.24,0:15:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你再给我打印一份新的 好弥补一下你无聊的童话故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}print me up a new report, spare me the boring fairy tale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.84,0:15:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要参加一个罗斯蒙特证券会议 一小时以后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got the Rosemont Equities meeting, one hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.88,0:15:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你说什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.22,0:15:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,11点 销售说明…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}11:00, sales presentation...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.22,0:15:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我以为 4点钟开始 - 我得将它提前 知道吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I thought that was at 4:00. - I had to move it, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.82,0:15:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那你现在才告诉我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're just telling me this now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.02,0:16:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Nick,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.36,0:16:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,80%的创业者在前两年都是一事无成的 就像走上坡路一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}80% of all start-ups fail in the first two years. It is an uphill battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.03,0:16:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,每个人都要把自己的体重加进去 没有例外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone's got to pull their own weight. No exceptions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.50,0:16:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 没问题 我去拿电子表格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. No problem. I'll have the spreadsheets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.50,0:16:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你觉得自己不行我可以来办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can give the pitch myself if you think you can't handle it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.21,0:16:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said no problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.18,0:16:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.48,0:16:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,将你那套收起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You keep your shit together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.51,0:16:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不服气吗？我没功夫顾及你脑子里的狗屁想法 去他妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay? I can't have you pop another brain fart and fuck this thing up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.42,0:16:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,将你的桌子收拾干净 这里太乱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clean up your desk. It's a mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.69,0:16:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在讨论软件 它可以使你的手提电脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What we're talking about is software that will enable your handheld{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.52,0:16:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,与任何无线电科技连接\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to communicate with any wireless technology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.73,0:16:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,想象一下从这里可以 进入到你的所有科技领域中去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine being able to access all of your technology from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.23,0:16:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,设想一下 假设你在一辆出租车里 你在赶往会议的途中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Picture it. Say you're in a cab on your way to a meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.17,0:16:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你正在检查你的邮件 你在网上冲浪 突然来了一个电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're checking your e-mails, you're surfing the web, a call comes in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.77,0:16:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你的新客户决定他们 需要另外的产品形象设计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, your new client decides that they need additional product images{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.41,0:16:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,只给你一个小时的时间 在会议中说明他们所需要的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be included in the presentation that you're giving in an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.85,0:16:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你急忙赶到会议现场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You rush over to the job site{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.32,0:16:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,照几张jpeg图片 赶去开会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}snap a couple of jpegs, get to your meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.95,0:17:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,先生们 你们拥有的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And gentlemen, what you've got{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.69,0:17:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,只是你口袋里的一小块芯片而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is a slideshow in your pocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.60,0:17:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 那么…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.50,0:17:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,每个人都正在研发 下一代为手提服务的芯片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}everyone's developing next-gen software for handhelds,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.51,0:17:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,包括一些大企业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}including the big guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.51,0:17:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么他们会将钱送到你的腰包里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why put money into yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.08,0:17:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们现在就准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because ours is ready now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.08,0:17:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们与在Strike Line 工作的员工一起 坚信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We, with our partners at Strike Line, believe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.22,0:17:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不到一个季度我们的 产品就会占领市场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we can have this on the market within the quarter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.64,0:17:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 尼克 - 他有突发疾病什么的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nick. - Is he having a seizure or what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.51,0:17:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不 他有头痛病尼克 尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he gets headaches. Nick! Nick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.89,0:18:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,真抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.76,0:18:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我发誓 如果我再收到一份S E C 的通知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear, if I get one more S.E.C. notice,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.90,0:18:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我要将这一堆东西全烧了 然后移居到乔治敦开曼群岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna burn the whole stack and move this thing to the Caymans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.37,0:18:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好呀 那里天气也很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, the weather's nice there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.47,0:18:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这次会议上的事我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm... sorry about the meeting, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.04,0:18:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克 我本不该告诉你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick, I shouldn't have to tell you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.34,0:18:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,80%的创业者在前两年都是一事无成的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}80% of all start-ups fail within the first two years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.44,0:18:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们犯了一个错误 那会影响全局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We make one mistake, it affects everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.65,0:18:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能过回去将事情重来一遍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't go back and do this over again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.38,0:18:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你说得很对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're absolutely right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.15,0:18:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我向你保证这样的事 决不会再发生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assure you this will not happen again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.49,0:18:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,戴夫告诉我你最近状态不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dave tells me you've been having some problems lately{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.69,0:18:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,注意力不集中 记忆力减退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with concentrating and remembering stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.69,0:18:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你确定你没事吗？- 我很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you sure you're okay? - Yeah, I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.30,0:18:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这样 那… 那没什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really, it's... it's not a big deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.50,0:18:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我让你马上回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to just go home,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.10,0:18:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,休息一周给自己充充电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}take the rest of the week off and recharge the batteries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.70,0:18:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 坎拉罕先生 我真的能够工作的 - 尼克…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Callahan, really, I can work. - Nick...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.57,0:19:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.77,0:19:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,就这么决定了 回家吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's done. Just go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.05,0:19:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,一周后见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll see you in a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.65,0:20:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.41,0:20:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊亲爱的 你拿了我的太阳镜吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit. Baby, did you grab my sunglasses?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.25,0:20:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？没有我你该怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mm? What would you do without me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.26,0:21:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.33,0:21:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,真扫兴 布里斯托这个奸细\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, this is stupid! Bristol's a dick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.57,0:21:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是呀 一个顶替我晋升的奸细\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, a dick who'll get promoted{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.57,0:21:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我在这个会议中表现不出色的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}instead of me if I flake on this meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.41,0:21:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那么以后他就会毁了我们的星期天了？- 还有朱莉的生日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So he gets to ruin our Sundays? - And Julie's birthday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.11,0:21:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何 你应该将整个事情都推掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever, man. I'm telling you you should just blow the whole thing off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.58,0:21:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是呀 你知道 你是对的 我不需要这份工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right. I don't really need this job anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.72,0:21:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Great idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.72,0:21:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,当你被炒鱿鱼后 我相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure when you get fired, Trevor will last{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.69,0:21:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,没有你 特雷弗也会持续工作两周\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}two weeks at work without you, maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.65,0:21:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,"没有你 特雷弗也会持续工作两周"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Two weeks at work without you."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.86,0:21:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么你非要说这些？- 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why you got to say that? - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.23,0:21:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,大家等一下 我想照张像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh, guys, wait. I want to get a picture of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.77,0:21:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 你知道吗 亲爱的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice. And you know what, honey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.94,0:21:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以和我一起搬到纽约去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can move to New York with me and we can be starving artists together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.94,0:21:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那样岂不是很完美 嗯？- 系好你的安全带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Isn't that a perfect idea? - Put your seat belt on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.45,0:21:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 将安全带系上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Put it on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.58,0:22:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 真是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.57,0:22:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我还好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.33,0:23:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 亲爱的 你知道要穿哪件吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, pumpkin. Hey, do you know what you're gonna wear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.78,0:24:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,发生什么事了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.05,0:24:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.65,0:24:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick?{\r}
