Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.28,0:33:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他要发布一个信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like he had to send a message on this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.62,0:33:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不得不解雇特雷弗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've had to let Trevor go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.76,0:33:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那么我建议大家回去工作吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I suggest that we all get back to work, hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.89,0:33:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这是不是太突然了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't that seem a little harsh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.50,0:33:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.57,0:33:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 发生什么事了？- 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So what actually happened? - Excuse me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.24,0:33:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 如果特雷弗认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if Trevor thought{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.51,0:33:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这件事已经定了 为什么这笔交易吹了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it was a sure thing, why'd the deal fall apart?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.55,0:33:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,别开玩笑了 布里斯托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Bristol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.81,0:33:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你曾经做过特雷弗的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had Trevor's job once,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.25,0:33:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道那有多难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you know how hard it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.52,0:33:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我没命地干活 我没有失误过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, and I worked my ass off, I didn't make mistakes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.42,0:33:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我还得了奖励\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I got rewarded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.66,0:33:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？因为Strike Line公司的生意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why? 'Cause the Strike Line deal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.06,0:33:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,落到你们头上了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}fell on your lap?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.53,0:33:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该将与 R S B 的生意结束 而不是特雷弗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were supposed to close the R.S.B. deal, not Trevor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.57,0:33:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为你知道些隐秘的事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you think you know something we don't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.04,0:34:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我所知道的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.84,0:34:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,坎拉罕先生付钱 让我评价你们的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is Mr. Callahan pays me to be the judge of you people,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.24,0:34:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我对你的评价是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and right now my judgment is telling me that you'd much rather be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.58,0:34:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该坐在家里与朋友们看电视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at home watching "Oprah" with your friend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.78,0:34:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,而不是继续留在这个团队里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than working on this team any longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.68,0:34:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜你 尼克 你也被解雇了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations, Nick. You're fired too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.92,0:34:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,还有别人吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyone else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.59,0:34:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟 我爱你 但这不是你的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, man, but this was not your problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.50,0:34:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,去你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.77,0:34:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不是我们 布里斯托根本不能那么快被升职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it wasn't for us, Bristol wouldn't have been promoted in the first place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.70,0:34:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是想占他的职位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not taking orders from him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.80,0:34:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克 你在这地方拼命地工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick, you worked your ass off at this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.31,0:34:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这里做牛做马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You put your blood into this place, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.84,0:34:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是呀 我在这里做牛做马 而布里斯托却被升职了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I put my blood into this place, and Bristol's the one who gets promoted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.38,0:34:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克 这就是生意场你教我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick, that's business. You taught me that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.51,0:34:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 回去跟布里斯托道个歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, look. Go tell Bristol you're sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.65,0:34:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他你仍然有后遗症\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him you're still having side effects from the accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.22,0:34:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我唯一的后遗症是明白了人生太仓促\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only side effect I'm having is knowing life is way too short for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.76,0:34:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么 男人的专利？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this, a guy thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.76,0:35:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,特雷弗被冻结账户了 那么你就和他一起跳？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trevor gets canned, so you just jump off the bridge with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.13,0:35:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我从未想到过要提升布里斯托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I was never gonna move up with Bristol as my supervisor anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.03,0:35:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,自从那家伙被晋升了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever since the guy got promoted,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.84,0:35:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他一直在找借口解雇我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's just been looking for an excuse to fire me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.04,0:35:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那你就不要给他机会 - 你知道吗？事实上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, you didn't have to give him one. - You know what? The truth is,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.71,0:35:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,他才是个薄弱环节 是他毁了整个公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's the weak link. He's ruined the whole company,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.88,0:35:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,每个人都知道 你知道吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and everybody knows it. And you know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.01,0:35:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,从他的管治下脱离出来才是上策\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am better off just getting out from under him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.55,0:35:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不 尼克 你最好要回你的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Nick. You're better off with a job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.98,0:35:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉过你 我会去找另一份工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you, I'll find another one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.09,0:35:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,一个更好的 我们会过得很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A better one. We'll all be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.89,0:35:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你同样说过你会呆在 这儿而不去纽约 因为那样也行得通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You also told me to stay here and not go to New York, because that would be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.23,0:35:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.23,0:35:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是不能忘记在 那次事故中我们所失去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I just can't forget what we lost in that accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.41,0:35:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.25,0:35:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.45,0:35:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 一切会好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, it will be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.82,0:36:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,只是需要时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It just takes time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.09,0:36:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克 已经一年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick, it's been a year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.09,0:36:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我每天靠计算别人的照片为生 却只赚一点点钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I spend my days cataloguing other people's photo shoots for minimum wage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.43,0:36:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我有半个文件夹的东西要看 但我没有时间完成 现在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have half a portfolio and no time to finish it, and now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.90,0:36:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我得去找另一份工作这样我们可以付租金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, now I have to get another job so that we can pay our rent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.71,0:36:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.21,0:36:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.08,0:36:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.72,0:36:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这有关于我们的未来 我现在总算可以看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about the big picture. I finally see it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.06,0:36:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的一切杂事… 只是杂事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that other stuff is just... just stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.76,0:36:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 唯一重要的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, the only thing that is important{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.13,0:36:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们拥有彼此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is that we have each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.20,0:36:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这才是重点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all that counts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.00,0:36:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你总是像推销员一样 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always the salesman, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.29,0:37:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 也许我会成为一个技术复印编辑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mm. Maybe I'll be a technical copyeditor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.57,0:37:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那是布里斯托？混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that Bristol? Jerk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.83,0:37:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.77,0:37:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.17,0:37:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.05,0:38:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 完美的照片 - 太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Perfect shot. - Ah! Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.32,0:38:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.95,0:38:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 照得不错吧？- 你看上去很棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Isn't that great? - You look so good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.65,0:38:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,真好 你觉得怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice. So, what do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.32,0:38:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯？- 这戒指 亲爱的 很漂亮不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hmm? - The ring, honey. Isn't it beautiful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.69,0:38:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你相信是我自己选的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you believe I picked that thing out myself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.40,0:38:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 太美了 - 哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's fantastic. - Ooh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.56,0:38:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 是呀 很漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Sure, it's beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.70,0:38:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在考虑明年十月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're thinking next October.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.27,0:38:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你们打算请多少人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, how many people are you gonna invite?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.11,0:38:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,也许50个 只有重要的一些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, maybe 50. Just the important ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.74,0:38:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mmm. - Ah. Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.58,0:38:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 戴夫 布里斯托 - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dave Bristol. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.48,0:38:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你的同事吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From your office?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.55,0:38:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 像是我发明的这个工具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, right. Like I'd invite that tool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.29,0:38:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我喝完了 还有人需要吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like I'm out. Anyone else need more?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.59,0:38:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 不了 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.83,0:38:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,布里斯托 圣诞节快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bristol, merry Christmas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.16,0:38:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.75,0:39:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么？尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on, Nick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.05,0:39:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在干什么？- 布里斯托 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing? - Bristol, I'm sorry, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.95,0:39:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,真糟糕 我可以…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a klutz. Can I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.39,0:39:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊真是好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice. That's really nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.89,0:39:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.56,0:39:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,真尴尬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that's embarrassing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.26,0:39:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,真尴尬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so embarrassing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.92,0:40:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.07,0:42:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Nick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.31,0:42:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你需要这些电子表格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you need those spreadsheets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.37,0:42:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是在等一些客户的数据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just waiting on some numbers from the clients.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.11,0:42:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.58,0:42:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我是副总裁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the vice president.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.19,0:42:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 当然 我没有在找借口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, yeah, of course. I'm not trying to make excuses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.09,0:42:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是我搞定了Strike Line 公司的合同 不是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I pulled the Strike Line deal, not you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.49,0:42:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我没听明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. I'm just not following this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.50,0:42:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,特雷弗在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Trevor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.50,0:42:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,在外面跟客户见面 他说你知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At some off-site client meeting. He said you knew about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.50,0:42:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 没错 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, right. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.11,0:42:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 还有 布里斯托 把桌子收拾一下 乱七八糟的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and Bristol, clean up that desk. It's a mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.85,0:43:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我发誓 如果我再收到 一次证监会的通告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear, if I get one more S.E.C. notice,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.99,0:43:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我就把这堆东西烧了 然后送到南美鳄鱼那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am gonna burn the whole stack and move this thing to the Caymans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.96,0:43:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说那里天气不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I hear the weather's nice there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.96,0:43:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好像是吧 你感觉如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I guess. So how you feelin'?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.76,0:43:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,再好不过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, better than ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.30,0:43:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我要和一个准客户吃晚饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I'm having dinner with a potential investor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.64,0:43:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他可是个大客户 我们需要他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a big one. We need him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.70,0:43:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 好的开始是成功的一半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what they say about start-ups.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.84,0:43:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你全副武装上阵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you riding shotgun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.84,0:43:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会搞砸的 卡里恩先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't miss it for the world, Mr. Callahan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.51,0:43:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,"卡里恩先生" 叫得真可爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Mr. Callahan." That's cute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.93,0:44:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,"太平洋街"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Pacific Avenue."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.10,0:44:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是朱莉米勒摄影社\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've reached Julie Miller Photography.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.87,0:44:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我无法接电话 所以请留言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't take your call, so please leave a message,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.17,0:44:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,包括您的电话号码 和您想预约的日期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}including your phone number and the date you'd like to book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.07,0:44:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.08,0:44:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 朱莉米勒摄影社\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, hello there, Julie Miller Photography.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.11,0:44:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我是尼克拉森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Nick Larson calling,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.48,0:44:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我想和你预约在今晚与客户见面后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the date I would like to book is for tonight after my client meeting,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.52,0:44:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但愿见客户不会花太长时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which hopefully won't last too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.65,0:44:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,所以为何不给我回个电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So why don't you give me a call back{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.52,0:44:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我你有没有空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and let me know if that works for your schedule?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.86,0:44:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了 除非我会在家先见到你 好了 我爱你 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless of course I see you at home first. All right. I love you, babe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.74,0:45:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我到家啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey, I'm home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.38,0:45:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.95,0:45:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.47,0:45:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 尼克 我是妈妈 我希望你还好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Nick, it's Mom. I hope you're okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.24,0:45:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我的确好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd say so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.54,0:45:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,给我回电话 都几个星期没见了 我知道你很忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call me. I haven't seen you for weeks. I know you're busy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.68,0:45:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但是得让我知道你过得怎样啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but let me know how you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.36,0:46:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,为合作成功干杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A toast... to successful partnerships.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.63,0:46:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 干杯 - 干杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Salud. - Salud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.64,0:46:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你女儿长得又迷人又漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your daughter is charming and beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.11,0:46:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.64,0:46:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 那你呢 尼克？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mm. And what about you, Nick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.81,0:46:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这儿有亲人吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have family here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.25,0:46:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, just my mom. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.48,0:46:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸在我小时候就离开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My, uh... my father moved away when I was a kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.59,0:46:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,很遗憾听你这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah. I am very sorry to hear that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.72,0:46:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,看上去你过得还挺好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it seems that you turned out all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.93,0:46:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你可是给你老板添光了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have certainly made an impression on your boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.53,0:46:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,呵呵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.13,0:46:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克最近多了点儿第六感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick's had a bit of a magic touch lately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.37,0:46:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我只不过是尽量把事情简化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I just try to keep things simple, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.20,0:46:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,找到目标 然后尽力实现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Know what you want and try to make that happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.74,0:46:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这还不行的话 就从旁边的人手里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if that doesn't work out, you steal the file{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.34,0:46:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,把东西偷过来 然后盼着那个人是赢家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the guy sitting next to you and hope that one's a winner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.28,0:46:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 尼克 让我来谈点正事儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Nick. Well, let's get serious for a minute{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.92,0:47:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,把这些新数据告诉弗恩逖司先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and tell Mr. Fuentes about the new numbers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.36,0:47:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,现在吗？我们正谈得开心呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now? Oh, we're having such a good time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.39,0:47:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,新数据 尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The new numbers, Nick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.06,0:47:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在管弗恩逖司先生要一大笔投资\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're about to ask Mr. Fuentes for a large amount of money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.40,0:47:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你得从他口袋里把钱包弄到手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to dazzle the wallet out of his pocket{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.00,0:47:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,然后让它在桌上跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and make it dance on the table.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.74,0:47:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不了 真的 瑞安 还是由你来说吧 这是你的心血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, really, Ron, you take the glory. This is your baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.47,0:47:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,数据 尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The numbers, Nick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.41,0:47:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们真正谈论的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what we're, uh... we're really talking about{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.65,0:47:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.79,0:47:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,新一代掌上操作系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the next generation of hand-held operating systems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.40,0:47:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的软件基于因特网光传输协议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our software capitalizes on optical internet protocol,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.40,0:47:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,使用光波结构处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}using light-wave architectures for processing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.00,0:47:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,所以它将在多重波长下收发数据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so that it will send and receive data over multiple wavelengths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.97,0:47:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的系统可以在6个月内商业化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our system can be commercialized within six months,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.21,0:47:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,并且有了可用测试版本 以及贵公司的支持\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and with a working beta product and your company's backing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.84,0:48:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们预期 可以在负责人中 签定一个甚至两个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we can expect to sign one, maybe two of the incumbents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.45,0:48:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这样我们就能从中国生产商外购\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we'll minimize our front-end expenditures{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.85,0:48:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,从而最小化整个过程的支出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by outsourcing to a flex manufacturer in China.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.85,0:48:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,如果一切顺利的话 我们产品的边际效益就会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we're right, our product margins will add{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.09,0:48:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,在12个月内 为贵公司 的毛利增加500个基本点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}500 basis points to your company's gross margins within 12 months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.76,0:48:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,底线是 如果我们达到 预期销售额的三分之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bottom line, if we achieve one-third of the unit sales forecasted,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.59,0:48:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,就能使贵公司的现金流量翻倍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'll double your company's cash flow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.81,0:48:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.25,0:48:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 怎么样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. How's it going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.66,0:48:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我正想拉直我的头发 我太无聊了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm about to pull out my hair, I'm so bored.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.39,0:48:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.46,0:48:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 关于所有无聊的技术性描述\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sorry for all the technobabble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.86,0:48:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上 你知道吗 那才是让我兴奋的部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, you know, that's the part that got me hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.70,0:48:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,格雷斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grace?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.97,0:49:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.47,0:49:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.64,0:49:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝 已经一个星期了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baby, it's been a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.84,0:49:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你要我求你吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, you want me to beg for it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.28,0:49:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我们可是在饭店里呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa. Hey. Hey hey hey. We're in a restaurant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.12,0:49:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这个什么时候又能阻止你？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When has that ever stopped you before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.20,0:49:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我操\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.53,0:49:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,停一下 你爸就在外面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold up. Your dad's right outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.57,0:49:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不在乎这个 他也不在乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care about that, and neither does he.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.57,0:49:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,再说了 大不了我再让他给你升职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, I'll just tell him to give you another raise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.05,0:49:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Nick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.59,0:49:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要你 - 听到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I want you, Nick. - I hear you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.47,0:50:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.73,0:50:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.35,0:50:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我的上帝 你在干吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my God. What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.28,0:50:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们玩儿点有意思的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's have some fun here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.62,0:50:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,笑一个 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smile, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.39,0:50:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh-uh. Hey...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.92,0:51:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我会再联系你的 - 你永远最受欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll be in touch. - You're most welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.03,0:51:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你做的很好 尼克 谢谢你能来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did great, Nick. Thanks for coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.03,0:51:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊尼克 感谢你过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Nick. Thanks for coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.19,0:52:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 上帝 - 你去哪儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh! Jesus! - Where were you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.86,0:52:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我都等了2个小时了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was waiting for two hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.40,0:52:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,特雷弗 冷静 伙计 我和卡林去吃晚餐了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trevor, settle down, man. I was at dinner with Callahan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.70,0:52:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 我告诉过你 我们需要谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? I told you, we need to talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.70,0:52:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 到底怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.57,0:52:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我和我的一个投资人出了问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got a problem with one of my investors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.31,0:52:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁？- 马尔科姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who? - Malcolm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.45,0:52:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- "马尔科姆"？- 你在耍我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- "Malcolm"? - Are you playing with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.55,0:52:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,马尔科姆 俱乐部认识的 我们拿了他的钱 你谈好的合同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Malcolm, from the club. We took his money. You closed the deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.39,0:52:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你脑袋有毛病了？醒醒 - 马尔科姆 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is your head fucked? Come on! - Malcolm, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.62,0:52:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,对 怎么了？发生什么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. What's up? What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.12,0:52:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那钱 他想要回他的钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The money... h-he-he... he wants it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.66,0:52:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 多少钱？- 所有的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right. How much? - All of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.36,0:52:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 25万 - "25万"？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 250 grand. - "250 grand"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.27,0:52:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是他打的你吗？- 是他的手下 当是个提醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did he do that to you? - It was one of his guys, as a reminder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.04,0:52:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 听我说 尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just listen. Listen to me, Nick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.34,0:53:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你得弄到这笔钱 伙计 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got to make this happen, man, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.28,0:53:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我无法糊弄这个家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause I can't mess around with this guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.01,0:53:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我 我不敢让他再等了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I...I...I can't make him wait anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.58,0:53:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 特雷弗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Trevor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.42,0:53:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,让我跟瑞安谈谈 我会搞定这件事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll talk to Ron. I'll take care of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.05,0:53:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么大不了的 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's no big deal. All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.22,0:53:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对 对 好吧 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. Yeah, all right. - All right, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.96,0:53:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我欠你一辈子 兄弟 - 不 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I owe you my life, man. - No no. Dude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.43,0:53:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没事儿的 - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's all right. - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.50,0:53:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.84,0:53:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你最近和朱莉说过话吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, uh... you talk to Julie lately?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.91,0:53:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没 有一阵没说过话了 怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Not in a while. Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.71,0:53:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直找不到她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm having a hard time tracking her down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.94,0:53:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.55,0:53:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,上次你告诉我 你俩分手了 是吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You told me last time, you're done with her, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.32,0:53:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.89,0:54:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞安 怎么样了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ron. How's it going, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.20,0:54:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,糟透了 弗恩逖司的生意丢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For shit. Fuentes bailed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.20,0:54:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？你不是开玩笑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? You got to be kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.24,0:54:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,昨晚过后 我还以为我们搞定他了呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After last night I thought we had him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.34,0:54:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊操他妈的 他的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, fuck him. His mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.54,0:54:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.81,0:54:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我不想火上浇油 但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I hate to pile on, man, but, um,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.91,0:54:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来我们的一个投资人出现问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it seems we have a problem with one of our investors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.65,0:54:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 是吗？- 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, yeah? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.92,0:54:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,盖伊特雷弗7月份带进来的 给我们投资了25万？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guy Trevor brought in back in July, gave us 250 grand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.69,0:54:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,总之 他说他想把钱要回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, he says, uh... he says he wants it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.96,0:55:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就这样？- 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's it? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.20,0:55:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那不过是点儿零花钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's pocket change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.20,0:55:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,为何你不去把我桌上的 支票本拿来 自己写上钱数？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you just go get the checkbook off my desk and write it yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.24,0:55:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞安 太感谢你了 伙计 我就知道你会理解的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ron, thank you so much, man. I knew you'd understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.37,0:55:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,为何不在我桌上也写点别的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you write a few more while you're at it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.94,0:55:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 不如你到那儿去 用牛奶和饼干把他们吓晕好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, just go down to the corner and pass 'em out with milk and cookies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.55,0:55:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你真的要送出些钱的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, if you really want to give some money away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.38,0:55:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这样的 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not like that, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.05,0:55:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克 我们有合同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick, we have contracts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.62,0:55:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,上面写的有何时 何种情况才能拿到钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that specify how and when people get paid back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.75,0:55:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 我也能理解 但是 以后不会再发生这种事儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. I understand. Look, it is a one-time thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.26,0:55:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,下次做生意时我会给你补上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll make it up to you on the next deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.96,0:55:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白 昨天我们 谈话时你一直在睡觉吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't get it. Were you asleep for our entire conversation yesterday?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.57,0:55:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,哪次谈话？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which... which one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.64,0:55:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉你我们破产了的那次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The one where I told you we're broke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.94,0:55:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 尼克 我们没钱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Nick, the money is gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.51,0:55:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,无论再怎么说 我们还是没钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No matter how many times we go over it, it is gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.81,0:55:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们花的比我们赚的还要多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've spent it... everything we had and more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.45,0:55:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 瑞安 这不可能 - 你不这么想罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ron, that's not possible. - You wouldn't think so,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.59,0:56:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,但是由于某些因素 我们曾试着摆脱困境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but somehow we managed to pull it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.76,0:56:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那次Strike Line公司的交易呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the Strike Line deal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.00,0:56:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克 你是个优秀的推销员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick, you're a good salesman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.04,0:56:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你为我的公司做了很多贡献\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've done a lot of great things for my company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.81,0:56:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我很高兴把你提拔成副总\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad I made you V.P.,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.31,0:56:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,但还是让我们面对现实吧 那个生意你搞砸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but let's face it... you blew it on that one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.62,0:56:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.85,0:56:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你在圣诞节期间跟他们谈生意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You approached them during Christmas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.95,0:56:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那时我们还没准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We weren't ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.96,0:56:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,无论你怎么想 尼克 你把他们给吓跑了 这是事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No matter how you look at it, Nick, you scared them off. That's the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.40,0:56:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike Line的生意不是我做的啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't make the Strike Line deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.50,0:56:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的 如果我们能把那个生意给盯死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, you know, if... if we had just nailed that deal,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.27,0:56:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们手上就很可能有些能用的软件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'd actually probably have some working software right now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.97,0:56:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,而不是现在这堆垃圾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}instead of this pile of garbage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.98,0:56:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.78,0:57:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 干得怎么样了？- 还在想办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So what's the story? - Still working on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.95,0:57:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克 快点 我今晚就要见马尔科姆了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick, come on, man. I'm meeting Malcolm tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.02,0:57:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我会搞定的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. I'm gonna take care of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.53,0:57:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.37,0:57:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 朱莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Julie. Hey, it's, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.21,0:57:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 是我 尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's me, Nick, again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.61,0:57:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我知道我们之间有些问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}listen, I know that there's some stuff between us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.22,0:57:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,而显然你不给我回电话 但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you're obviously not calling me back, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.52,0:57:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的很想和你谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd really like to talk to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.55,0:57:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,给你迟到的生日祝福 还有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy belated birthday, and, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.96,0:57:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I miss you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.22,0:58:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喂？- 尼克 终于打通了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello? - Nick. Finally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.55,0:58:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 你好 妈妈 - 你还好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, hey, Mom. - How are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.79,0:58:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,还好 什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine, uh, what's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.59,0:58:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我和你爸的医生谈过了 他想见见你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've spoken to your father's doctor. He'd like to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.19,0:58:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你愿意和他说话吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you talk to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.40,0:58:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？这是什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why? What... what do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.87,0:58:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我很担心你 我真的很想来看看你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm concerned about you. I really want to come and see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.64,0:58:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 妈妈 我很好 - 不是的 我真的很想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No no, I'm good, Mom. I'm fine. - No, I really...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.07,0:58:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我得走了 好吗 我会再打给你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, listen, I got to go, okay? I'll call you later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.81,0:58:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 尼克 - 我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nick... - I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.81,0:58:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.29,0:58:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看看 哦 看上去不错啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me see. Oh, looks good, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.24,1:00:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,朱莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Julie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.85,1:00:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.38,1:00:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.52,1:00:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,差点没认出你来 你看上去变了好多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hardly recognized you, you look so different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.79,1:00:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 谢谢 我想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, thanks, I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.25,1:00:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我是说 你看上去很漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I mean, you look beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.29,1:00:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你留了一大堆留言 你收到了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, I left you a bunch of messages. Did you get 'em?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.83,1:00:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我收到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I got 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.43,1:00:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.50,1:00:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我知道我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. I know I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.57,1:00:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我有点儿失礼了 我只想和你谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a little carried away. I just really wanted to talk to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.11,1:00:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我就站在这儿 谈吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm standing here, so go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.84,1:00:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你在做什么呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um... What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.05,1:00:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我在工作 - 在酒吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm working. - At a club?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.38,1:00:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 在夜总会 我正在为时装秀拍照\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, at a club. I'm shooting a fashion show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.52,1:01:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 不错 谁介绍的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's cool. Who hooked that up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.46,1:01:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,克里斯多佛 他把我介绍给几个人 然后就这么定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christopher. He introduced me to a few people and it just took off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.53,1:01:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,谁是克里斯多佛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow. Who's Christopher?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.53,1:01:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 宝贝 - 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, baby. - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.30,1:01:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你给我打电话了？- 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You call me? - I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.43,1:01:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这又是谁？- 哦 尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And who's this? - Oh, uh, Nick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.17,1:01:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,老朋友 我们正谈着呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Old friend. We're just catching up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.41,1:01:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克 她是最棒的 不是吗 她会成为明星的 对吧 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick, she's the greatest, isn't she? She's gonna be a star, aren't you, baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.18,1:01:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我要再去喝杯酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I'm gonna get another drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.18,1:01:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我用给你带点儿什么吗？- 好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I get you something? - Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.68,1:01:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 尼克 你呢？- 不用了 我很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nick? - No, I'm good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.88,1:01:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.19,1:01:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,朱莉 朱莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Julie. Julie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.19,1:01:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.63,1:01:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我们之间有些问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know some stuff went wrong with us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.83,1:01:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,但你要相信我 我从没有想过这样分手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you have to believe me, I never meant for it to end up like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.83,1:01:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 别说废话了 尼克 你知道吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, cut the shit, Nick. You know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.90,1:01:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你得到了所有你想要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got everything exactly the way you wanted it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.80,1:01:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,所以别又从现在开始关心我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so don't start caring about me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.44,1:01:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉你 无论我说了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am telling you, whatever I said,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.01,1:01:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,做了什么 无论我俩之间发生了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whatever I did, whatever... happened between us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.18,1:01:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,都从你脑海里忘掉吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just... just wipe it out of your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.51,1:02:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你还不明白吗？我已经都忘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you get it? I already have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.12,1:02:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗 你一直在说你的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, and all your talk about your job{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.52,1:02:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,和我的职业 我们的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and my career, the future,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.82,1:02:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那只是 尼克 说说而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's all it was, Nick... talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.92,1:02:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但是现在 我自己做老板了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now I'm my own boss,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.79,1:02:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,并且第一次按照自己的想法去做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and for the first time I'm doing exactly what I want to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.33,1:02:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.33,1:02:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你想要什么 不是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what you want, and it's not this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.74,1:02:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 人是会变的 - 我们没变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Things change. - Not us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.97,1:02:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,朱莉 我们可以重新开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Julie, we can start over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.88,1:02:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,就给我个机会吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just give me a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.32,1:02:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她的电话 不是吗？- 谁的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's her, isn't it? - Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.06,1:02:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,格雷斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.76,1:02:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,朱莉 不是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Julie, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.33,1:02:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你是这世界上我唯一关心的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are the only thing in this world that matters to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.27,1:02:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道为何我曾迷失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know how I lost sight of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.20,1:02:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,但我能恢复过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can fix this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.40,1:02:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我向你保证 我会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise you I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.87,1:03:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不愧是个推销员 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always the salesman, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.31,1:03:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.23,1:03:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克 哦 感谢上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick. Oh, thank God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.36,1:03:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,看 我跟你说他会来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, I told you he'd show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.36,1:03:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我很高兴你能来 尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm really glad you could make it, Nick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.90,1:03:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我猜你就是马尔科姆 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Malcolm, I assume. - Yeah,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.63,1:03:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很高兴终于面对面见到你 - 我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- good to meet you face to face finally. - And you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.70,1:03:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这是韦恩 他是我合伙人 拥有夜总会的一半股份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Wayne. He owns half the club with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.34,1:03:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,韦恩？尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wayne? Nick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.01,1:03:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.01,1:03:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,坐吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have a seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.69,1:03:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.13,1:03:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,马尔科姆 这个地方真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Malcolm, this space is fantastic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.53,1:03:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,多谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.34,1:04:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,请尝尝 一些红茶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go. A little black tea{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.81,1:04:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,加上人参和芒果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with ginseng and mango.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.41,1:04:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们管它叫中国火箭燃料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We call it Chinese rocket fuel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.61,1:04:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,使你头脑和身体保持清醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keeps you sharp, mind and body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.61,1:04:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来对你很有效啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems to be working for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.52,1:04:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你为什么会来这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know why you're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.52,1:04:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你想重新谈谈你的合同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to renegotiate your contract.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.19,1:04:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.99,1:04:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你的朋友做了很多承诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your friend made a lot of promises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.46,1:04:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他说能让我凭着某种 涡轮增压般的超级电话软件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Said he could get me in on the ground floor, triple my money with some sort of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.23,1:04:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,站着就让我的钱翻成3倍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}turbocharged super-phone software,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.00,1:04:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是专业人士但这听起来很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm no expert, but it sounded pretty good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.67,1:04:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,确实是很好 马尔科姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it is, Malcolm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.97,1:04:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这都是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.97,1:04:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个非常好的软件 我确信你的投资能得到超值回报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is an excellent product. I'm sure your investment will see a great return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.48,1:04:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,马尔科姆 我不知道 什么才是你想要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Malcolm, I'm not sure what it is you're looking for,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.68,1:04:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果你看看合同 就会发现 我们离合同期限还早着呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but if you look at your contract, you'll see we're well within our timeline.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.05,1:04:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 但是有时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, but at some time,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.25,1:04:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要感觉到事情正在进展中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to feel like there's some sort of progress going on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.52,1:04:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那好 我该怎样帮你有这种感觉呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Well, how can I help you feel like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.16,1:05:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你看 我们是机构的一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, we're part of an organization.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.20,1:05:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,一系列命令的运作总得有个过程 这就是生意如何运作的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a chain of command. It's the way things are done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.00,1:05:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是为什么在合同上注明了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is why we sign contracts that specify{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.40,1:05:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,何时何种情况下才能得到收益\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how and when people are paid back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.60,1:05:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个商人 你知道整个生意是怎么进行的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a businessman. You know how the whole thing works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.68,1:05:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你曾希望能预知未来吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever wished you could look into the future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.82,1:05:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,中国人相信 通过茶叶的形态 就能预测未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Chinese believe it's possible just by looking at a pattern of tea leaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.16,1:05:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 现在的问题是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So... the question is,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.59,1:05:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我是看到你们所说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}do I see a waterfall{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.10,1:05:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,瀑布般从天而降的钞票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}dripping with all the money you guys are gonna make me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.13,1:05:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,看到我给你们的钱都在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I see a little bonfire cooking as everything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.87,1:05:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 篝火的烟雾中消失 - 不是这样的 马尔科姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I gave you goes up in smoke? - That's not it, Malcolm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.94,1:05:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你要能证明给我看的话就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm dying for you to prove me otherwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.01,1:05:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I can help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.21,1:05:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,由于你和特雷弗的关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because of your relationship with Trevor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.51,1:05:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,还有我对产品的信心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and my confidence in this product,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.52,1:05:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我写了张投资钱数10%的个人支票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've written you a personal check for 10%.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.12,1:06:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,25万中的2万5？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}25 thousand out of 250?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.89,1:06:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这不过是你的投资\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a Band-Aid until your...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.20,1:06:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,得到回报前的一点儿零头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your investment sees its return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.97,1:06:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,一点儿零头 我喜欢一点儿零头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Band-Aids. I love Band-Aids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.51,1:06:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你看到了吧 我告诉过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you see? I told you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.81,1:06:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克正在做这笔生意 他会把一切都管好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick's on this now, and he's gonna take care of everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.62,1:06:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,有一点儿总比没有强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's better than nothing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.72,1:06:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是目前我能拿到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which is all I've gotten from you so far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.22,1:06:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 也许现在该废话少说了 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, maybe it's time we cut out the middlemen, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.47,1:06:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.74,1:06:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,把他弄出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.02,1:07:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.09,1:07:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不要 - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No! - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.40,1:07:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,在这儿等着 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay in here, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.40,1:07:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 让让 快出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, move, move! Get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.63,1:07:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的 快出去 现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit! Get out! Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.14,1:07:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck! Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.77,1:07:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,朱莉？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Julie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.81,1:07:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,朱莉？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Julie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.81,1:07:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 尼克？- 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nick? - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.05,1:07:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,朱莉 不要 我操\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Julie! Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.22,1:07:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 朱莉 哦 上帝 - 发生什么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, Julie! Oh, my God! - What's happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.82,1:07:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,嘘 我爱你 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shh. Shh. I love you, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.99,1:07:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你 你还好 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you. You're okay, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.49,1:07:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿 别回头 嘿 看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. Don't look. Here here. Hey, look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.93,1:07:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我 一切都好 知道吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me, look at me. Everything's fine. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.30,1:07:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会有事儿的 嘘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're okay. Shh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.23,1:07:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,快呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.20,1:07:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.44,1:07:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,呼吸 快呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breathe. Just breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.58,1:08:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.31,1:08:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 格雷斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Grace!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.69,1:08:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.86,1:08:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,终于发现怎样能把你弄醒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Found something that would wake you up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.36,1:08:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这他妈的怎么回事儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.36,1:08:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,放松点儿 你正在享受呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax. You're enjoying it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.90,1:09:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你的衣服在地上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your shit's on the floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.94,1:09:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,想喝点儿什么吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want something to drink?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.22,1:09:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.56,1:09:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么到这儿的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did I get here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.53,1:09:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你真他妈可爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are so bloody cute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.64,1:09:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 回答我的问题 - 把你的手从我身上拿开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Answer the question. - Get your hands off of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.08,1:09:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你不记得我了？我们在夜总会见过面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't remember me? We met at the club.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.55,1:09:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我和马尔科姆 无论什么事情上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Malcolm and I are partners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.22,1:09:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,都是合伙人 这就意味着 我也拥有你的一半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On everything. Which means I own half your ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.09,1:10:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你欠我们25万\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand you owe us $250,000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.30,1:10:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你表现好的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you hadda behaved yourself,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.40,1:10:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以说服马尔科姆管你少要点儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could've persuaded Malcolm into reducing your bill,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.57,1:10:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,但在他来之前 你哪儿也不能去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but now you're not going anywhere until he gets here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.94,1:10:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,听明白没？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you get it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.92,1:10:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你要找死的话 我相信 特雷弗和你女朋友都会同意的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure your girlfriend and Trevor would agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.16,1:10:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,去你妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.24,1:10:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我真把事情给搞砸了 妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really screwed things up, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.91,1:10:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我如此努力去挽救一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried so hard to fix everything, to just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.58,1:10:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,要把事情做好 但每次 却把事情变得更坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}make things right, and every time I do I make it so much worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.91,1:10:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我甚至都不再知道自己是谁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't even know who I am anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.15,1:10:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样 你说话的样子 让我想起了你爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't. You remind me of your father when you talk like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.95,1:11:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么？- 你总想掌控一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why? - You try to control everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.93,1:11:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈 我想和爸爸谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, I want to talk to Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.60,1:11:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你不能 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you can... you can't, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.26,1:11:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你不明白 这真的很重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't understand. It's really important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.07,1:11:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 你不明白 - 妈妈 你得帮我找到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, you don't understand. - Mom, you've gotta help me find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.74,1:11:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克 他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick, he's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.78,1:11:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他自杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He committed suicide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.91,1:11:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么之前不告诉我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would you keep that from me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.62,1:11:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.35,1:11:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想让你在这种情况下记住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't want you to remember him like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.22,1:11:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是 尼克 你才是我所担心的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The point is, Nick, it's you I'm worried about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.26,1:11:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你独自承受不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't do this alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.59,1:11:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去找个医生看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to see a doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.46,1:11:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你不一定非得和你爸的命运一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to have the same fate as your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.77,1:11:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克 你无法掌控一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick, you can't control everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.77,1:11:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是时候放手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to let it go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.72,1:12:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,请再来一杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another drink, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.86,1:12:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.20,1:12:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克 怎么回事儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick. What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.20,1:12:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.33,1:12:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你发生什么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.71,1:12:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,带来了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you bring it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.52,1:12:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,特雷弗在哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Trevor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.76,1:12:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我都不敢相信这是一年前的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe that was only a year ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.99,1:12:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道有些地方不对劲儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know something's wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.26,1:12:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,先是特雷弗带着黑眼眶回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, Trevor comes home with a black eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.76,1:12:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,然后他说你们要开些会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then he says you have some meeting together,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.07,1:12:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但他根本就不回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he doesn't come home at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.77,1:12:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你又让我带些旧照片过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now you want me to bring you some old picture?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.91,1:13:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克 我真的很害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick, I'm really scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.88,1:13:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.15,1:13:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我愿意为特雷弗 做任何事情 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that I'd do anything for Trevor, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.89,1:13:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我愿为你们做任何事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd do anything for all you guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.72,1:13:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.29,1:13:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.50,1:13:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你很害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you're scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.04,1:13:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以解释的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't explain it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.38,1:13:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,但我向你保证特雷弗没事儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I promise you that Trevor's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.64,1:14:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 好极了 伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, great, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.20,1:14:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,看好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check it out...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.11,1:14:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我带来了我特制的生日蜡烛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I brought my own special birthday candle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.38,1:14:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好啊 - 这可是毒品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes! - It's drugs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.04,1:14:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我的最爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! My favorite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.95,1:14:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,点蜡烛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Light it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.19,1:14:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 点蜡烛 - 好的 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Light it. - Yes yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.16,1:14:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你去哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.16,1:14:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 随便转转 - 哦 真的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Somewhere. - Oh, really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.86,1:15:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,和你一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.96,1:15:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.40,1:15:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我要单独和你谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to talk to you alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.04,1:15:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,穿上这个 天气可能会变冷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put this on, it might get cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.92,1:15:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,啊这里就跟你第一次带我来时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah. This looks exactly the same as it did{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.88,1:15:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,看上去一摸一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you first brought me here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.95,1:15:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,简直不敢相信 那是什么时候？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe... when was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.59,1:15:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 3年前 - 3年前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Three years ago. - Three years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.40,1:15:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 我无法想象 没有你我的人生会怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't imagine my life without you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.54,1:15:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克 我想跟你说点事儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick, I want to tell you something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.50,1:15:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我先说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.24,1:15:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.01,1:15:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你得去纽约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to go to New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.68,1:15:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 我知道这听起来很奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - I know that it sounds strange,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.95,1:15:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,但是请相信我 这是为你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but trust me, it's for the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.22,1:15:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这都哪儿跟哪儿啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is this coming from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.99,1:15:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你追求艺术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your chance to pursue your art,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.92,1:16:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,发现自我的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to... find out about yourself,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.99,1:16:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不必再为我 为我们 为我的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to not have to worry about me or us or my job{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.86,1:16:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,或其它的事情担忧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or all that other bullshit, just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.06,1:16:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不想这么自由 - 听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't want to be free. - Listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.06,1:16:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你最后一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your last chance to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.54,1:16:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,可以追求自己生活轨迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pursue your own path in life,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.14,1:16:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,又不会被我破坏的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one that I can't fuck up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.64,1:16:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想追求自己的生活轨迹 不是那么回事儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I don't want to pursue my own path. That wasn't the deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.41,1:16:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 听着 - 我们可以在一起的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Listen. - We were going to do this together{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.98,1:16:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,可以一起解决问题 并且你答应过我 会和我在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we were gonna work it out, and you promised you would be there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.55,1:16:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我吧 我知道 宝贝 你没明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just trust me, I know, baby. I don't think you're getting it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.19,1:16:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,朱莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Julie...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.40,1:16:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是现在需要一点私人空间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just need a little space myself right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.87,1:16:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.91,1:16:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你要和我分手吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're breaking up with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.31,1:16:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就这样了？- 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's it? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.65,1:17:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得没什么好说的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think there's anything left to be said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.90,1:17:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,尼克 我怀孕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick, I'm pregnant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.56,1:17:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,特雷弗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trevor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.49,1:17:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,朱莉在哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Julie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.83,1:17:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 发生什么事儿了？- 伙计 她跑下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened? - Yeah, dude, she ran down here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.83,1:17:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,拿了你的钥匙 然后开走了你的车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}grabbed your keys and took off to your car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.98,1:18:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不 哦 上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Oh God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.82,1:18:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 我们开始 - 继续走到点上然后回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right, here we go. - Keep going to the point and back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.80,1:18:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计 你在干吗？这是我的车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, man, what are you doing? That's my car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.36,1:18:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,慢点儿 求你了 慢点儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slow down. Please, slow down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.53,1:18:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.24,1:19:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 真是开玩笑 - 朱莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, you've got to be kidding. - Julie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.75,1:19:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 上帝 - 停车 朱莉 求求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- God! - Pull over, Julie, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.39,1:19:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了 快停车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, pull over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.76,1:19:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry! I love you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.33,1:19:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know! I'm sorry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.30,1:19:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,朱莉 你一定得停车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Julie, you have to pull over!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.77,1:19:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,停车 你不理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull over! You don't understand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.47,1:19:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.71,1:19:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我的上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.18,1:19:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.27,1:20:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我愿为你们做任何事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would do anything for all you guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.60,1:20:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道的 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.61,1:20:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 尼克 你醒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Nick. You're awake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.91,1:20:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 宝贝 今天可是很重要啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, baby, we've got a big day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.25,1:20:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,半小时候后我还有课\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got class in a half-hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.59,1:21:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了 小尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right, Nicky, yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.12,1:21:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈半小时内要赶到课堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy has to go to class in a half an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.46,1:21:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了 好吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.10,1:21:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我会把你放到奶奶家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna drop you off at Grandma's. Yeah!{\r}
